<BaseLayout lang="en" title="About Us">
  <div class="prose prose-amber max-w-none space-y-10">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-amber-900 border-b-2 border-amber-200 pb-2">About Vallalaar Aathi Inam</h2>
    
    <section>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-800">Traditional Lineage of Gurus (Guru Parampara)</h3>
      <ol class="list-decimal list-inside leading-relaxed text-gray-700 space-y-2 mt-4">
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of the Almighty Supreme Being, the Lord of Infinite Grace (Arutperunjothi)!</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of the Primordial (Adhi) Maha Yogi, who manifested as the first and foremost field of divine movement!</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of the Primordial (Adhi) Guru Nandiyam Peruman of the Sacred Kailash Lineage.</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of Thirumoola Nayanar, who received the grace of Nandiyam Peruman!</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of the First Siddhar, Kalangi Nathar.</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of the Ascetic Siddhar, Bogar.</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of the Ascetic Siddhar, Konganar.</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of the Ascetic Siddhar, Sattanathar.</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of the Ascetic Guru, Vaalai Gurusamy.</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of Balayananthar Swamigal.</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of Jaya Veera Aathi Nayak Swamigal.</li>
        <li>I surrender at the divine feet of Jyoti Ramasamy Desikar Swamigal.</li>
        <li>With mind, speech, and body, we worship the traditional Gurus who appeared within the divine heart of Sri Sivagurunatha Desikar to dispel the darkness of our ignorance. We also worship the divine feet of the Thiruvarutprakasa Vallal Peruman, who descended from the lineage of Thirugnanasambandar and provided sublime teachings so that all souls in this world may attain the Path of Light (Olineri).</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
